Package: zusbml
Title: Read, Write and Derive Equations from 'SBML' Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Reads Systems Biology Markup Language ('SBML') core
    documents, Level 3 Versions 1 and 2 and Level 2 Versions 4 and 5, into
    one R object, writes that object back as Level 3 Version 2, and derives
    from it the states, right-hand sides, assignments and events an
    ordinary differential equation solver needs, following the
    specification at <https://sbml.org/documents/specifications/>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Imports: 
    zuxml
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Suggests: 
    deSolve,
    parallel,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr,
    zujson
Enhances: 
    rxode2
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://pedrobtz.github.io/zusbml/, https://github.com/pedrobtz/zusbml
